[test_eval_zero_div_01] Evaluate expression with division by zero
expression : (a+b)/0=
variables  : a = 10, b = 20
[FAILED] eval() call returned false


[test_eval_zero_div_02] Evaluate expression with division by zero
expression : (a+b)/c=
variables  : a = 10, b = 20, c = 0
[FAILED] eval() call returned false


